## Phase 4 — Verify and sustain

### Era 13 — Verification & Sustaining (V43–V45) — ✅ done, verified 2026-09-17

`mint broken-links` clean after every step (Eras 3–12 combined). Full-repo disclosure sweep:
every checkpoint term from both `DISCLOSURE.md` and `DISCLOSURE-ADDENDUM.md` grepped across
all 30 concept pages — every hit reviewed and found compliant (public page/command names,
ordinary English, or the transcript's own explicitly-allowed rule-ordering language; zero
mechanism descriptions, zero fixes needed). Mandatory second read on
`ai-connections-and-alie.mdx` and `administrative-commands.mdx`: both re-read in full,
confirmed clean. Sustaining process folded into both `CLAUDE.md` files: `beaver-cli/CLAUDE.md`'s
existing "Keeping the public CLI reference in sync" checklist gained item 5 (new feature area
→ check whether a concept page is needed); this repo's own `CLAUDE.md` gained a Concepts
group description in its Guides-nav-groups line, pointing to `00-architecture.docs` and
`inventory/00-topics.docs`.

